[statement]
A package whose condition names a candidate's own name has its turn where
the walk reaches that candidate, though no dependency names the candidate.
`e`'s condition names `base`, reached as the candidate for `B`: `X`, which
`e` needs, is decided before `Y`, which `z` needs, for `hi`, and `lo` is
installed for `Y`.

[repository]
P:top
V:1
D:B z

P:base
V:1
p:B=1

P:z
V:1
D:Y

P:e
V:1
i:base
D:X

P:hi
V:1
k:100
p:X

P:lo
V:1
p:X Y=1

[request]
top

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install base 1
install hi 1
install e 1
install lo 1
install z 1
install top 1
